From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glacier <hyouga.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:23:40 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Preload a square of chunks a few requests per tick

AthenaChunkPreloader, drained in the tick loop after AthenaTeleportQueue,
sends at most perTick async chunk requests a tick, nearest the centre
first, skipping chunks already loaded and chunks the storage does not hold
(those would be generated on the server thread).

VPS, 20 bots, pin + preload 300 blocks at 4 per tick during pre-game:
1,165-1,186 chunks in 15-17 s, slowest 5 s of pre-game at 20.0 TPS; live
CPU 0.140 -> 0.129 (Par_72) and 0.135 -> 0.124 (Lobby_Games), young GCs
-5% / -30%.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

